{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "gdp6p5ohrgdw5nzg", "title": "78.多模态预训练数据集构建流程", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2402defb\" id=\"u2402defb\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u2d687161\" id=\"u2d687161\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752984017157-f64776b7-eaac-4016-ad90-f27b7290d231.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1ff5469a-c008-48a9-a199-0e770498b9a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u70ea7f34-f494-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A343.1111111111111%2C%22height%22%3A73%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A31406%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A772%2C%22originHeight%22%3A164%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BC%82%E6%9E%84%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%A8%E5%90%88%E8%A7%84%22%2C%22x%22%3A572%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BD%B1%E5%83%8F%E8%AF%8A%E6%96%AD%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A573%2C%22y%22%3A110%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A293%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%AD%94%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A292%2C%22y%22%3A110%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f4f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc63737c2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf6361ec4\" id=\"uf6361ec4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9529c59a\" id=\"u9529c59a\">多模态预训练数据集构建需解决</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua5ce21ff\" id=\"ua5ce21ff\">数据异构性、标注一致性、隐私合规性</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u80f71620\" id=\"u80f71620\">三大核心问题。以下以医疗影像诊断项目为例，说明从数据收集到落地的全流程解决方案。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf0757ac2\" id=\"uf0757ac2\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"1fff5f70\" id=\"1fff5f70\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07bb9cde\" id=\"u07bb9cde\">二、项目案例：医疗影像智能诊断系统<br /></span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752984040791-47801428-1662-4ba6-810a-8a4ba49eb8d1.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5fd027bf-6498-418f-847a-83ac3f45558%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u70ea7f34-f494-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A402.1111145019531%2C%22height%22%3A259%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A80583%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A754%2C%22originHeight%22%3A486%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%A8%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E9%AB%98%E6%98%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A576%2C%22y%22%3A90%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81%E5%90%88%E8%A7%84%E6%80%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A576%2C%22y%22%3A438%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%AD%A4%E5%B2%9B%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A573%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A155%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A160%2C%22width%22%3A153%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B8%85%E6%B4%97%E5%A2%9E%E5%BC%BA%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A575%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A154%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E5%8C%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A369%2C%22width%22%3A128%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%9A%E6%A8%A1%E6%80%81%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A575%2C%22y%22%3A300%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A296%2C%22y%22%3A299%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E7%97%9B%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A296%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf7459080%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"eb5e395f\" id=\"eb5e395f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u023dd548\" id=\"u023dd548\">场景与痛点</span></strong></h4><ul list=\"u09a1ff78\"><li fid=\"u45addae0\" data-lake-id=\"u8ca5a5d5\" id=\"u8ca5a5d5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u24a1a06a\" id=\"u24a1a06a\">场景需求</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4c796d34\" id=\"u4c796d34\">：构建能同时解析CT影像和诊断报告的多模态模型，辅助医生识别肺部结节。</span></li><li fid=\"u45addae0\" data-lake-id=\"u9ab0f248\" id=\"u9ab0f248\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufc58010f\" id=\"ufc58010f\">核心痛点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2fc1ad19\" id=\"u2fc1ad19\">： </span></li></ul><ol list=\"u902daf21\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uc5a0d0f1\" data-lake-id=\"u16249c36\" id=\"u16249c36\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u67675ef5\" id=\"u67675ef5\">数据孤岛</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1a3fac25\" id=\"u1a3fac25\">：影像存储在PACS系统（DICOM格式），报告为PDF/手写文本，无法直接关联。</span></li><li fid=\"uc5a0d0f1\" data-lake-id=\"u6d9af693\" id=\"u6d9af693\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u90d9d815\" id=\"u90d9d815\">标注成本</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8cdf570e\" id=\"u8cdf570e\">：医学标注需放射科专家，单个病例标注耗时30分钟。</span></li><li fid=\"uc5a0d0f1\" data-lake-id=\"u0754ee77\" id=\"u0754ee77\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1464977c\" id=\"u1464977c\">隐私合规</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9e216df7\" id=\"u9e216df7\">：患者数据需脱敏处理，需符合HIPAA和GDPR双标准。</span></li><li fid=\"uc5a0d0f1\" data-lake-id=\"ua07c91ad\" id=\"ua07c91ad\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua3569456\" id=\"ua3569456\">模态对齐</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u63976d98\" id=\"u63976d98\">：同一患者的影像与报告时间戳错位率达40%。</span></li></ol><h4 data-lake-id=\"dfe8ff94\" id=\"dfe8ff94\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u16ec0e61\" id=\"u16ec0e61\">解决方案流程</span></strong></h4><h5 data-lake-id=\"76b56a94\" id=\"76b56a94\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u267dee26\" id=\"u267dee26\">1. 数据收集与源管理</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u3cf946f1\"><li fid=\"ub7ff2402\" data-lake-id=\"u3e28fe25\" id=\"u3e28fe25\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3ddb704b\" id=\"u3ddb704b\">多源接入</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u296370b7\" id=\"u296370b7\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u3cf946f1\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u3a032c8c\" data-lake-id=\"u86317c73\" id=\"u86317c73\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b45753c\" id=\"u9b45753c\">PACS系统API自动拉取DICOM影像（含患者ID、检查日期）。</span></li><li fid=\"u3a032c8c\" data-lake-id=\"ua211179b\" id=\"ua211179b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31e0cad0\" id=\"u31e0cad0\">OCR识别历史PDF报告（Tesseract+自定义规则解析段落）。</span></li><li fid=\"u3a032c8c\" data-lake-id=\"udf16074b\" id=\"udf16074b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4166fc5a\" id=\"u4166fc5a\">开发</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9340b9ea\" id=\"u9340b9ea\">患者ID映射中间件</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u782b5d1e\" id=\"u782b5d1e\">，关联同一患者的影像与报告（解决时间戳错位问题）。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u3cf946f1\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"ub7ff2402\" data-lake-id=\"u45646042\" id=\"u45646042\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud910003e\" id=\"ud910003e\">数据量级</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7bd4a744\" id=\"u7bd4a744\">：收集10万病例，其中8万用于预训练，2万用于微调。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"38f37b7b\" id=\"38f37b7b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub07b909f\" id=\"ub07b909f\">2. 数据清洗与增强</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u61d79a31\"><li fid=\"uc48e333e\" data-lake-id=\"u4529f709\" id=\"u4529f709\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u28464db7\" id=\"u28464db7\">影像处理</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u771ea4a4\" id=\"u771ea4a4\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u61d79a31\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u7bc0f054\" data-lake-id=\"uc4eaf590\" id=\"uc4eaf590\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf37010c9\" id=\"uf37010c9\">去噪：使用非局部均值滤波（Non-Local Means）消除CT伪影。</span></li><li fid=\"u7bc0f054\" data-lake-id=\"u5d1b684f\" id=\"u5d1b684f\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc42613d\" id=\"udc42613d\">标准化：将HU值（Hounsfield Unit）归一化到[-1000, 2000]窗宽。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u61d79a31\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uc48e333e\" data-lake-id=\"uf3070218\" id=\"uf3070218\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub2869082\" id=\"ub2869082\">文本处理</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u934837f1\" id=\"u934837f1\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u61d79a31\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u11f263a8\" data-lake-id=\"ud15c860b\" id=\"ud15c860b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41793deb\" id=\"u41793deb\">实体掩码：用[医生]替代报告中的医生签名，[医院]替代机构名称。</span></li><li fid=\"u11f263a8\" data-lake-id=\"ufbb535f6\" id=\"ufbb535f6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89e5d1eb\" id=\"u89e5d1eb\">术语归一化：将“毛玻璃影”统一为“磨玻璃结节”（GGO）。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u61d79a31\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"uc48e333e\" data-lake-id=\"u13d25727\" id=\"u13d25727\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u29abb47e\" id=\"u29abb47e\">数据增强</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u45ea3b95\" id=\"u45ea3b95\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u61d79a31\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"udfbb08ba\" data-lake-id=\"u541dbc26\" id=\"u541dbc26\"><span data-lake-id=\"u115a9278\" id=\"u115a9278\">影像：随机旋转±5°、添加高斯噪声（σ=0.01）。</span></li><li fid=\"udfbb08ba\" data-lake-id=\"uf64d5ad7\" id=\"uf64d5ad7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue08f9bc6\" id=\"ue08f9bc6\">文本：使用SynonymSwap替换医学术语同义词（如“癌变→恶性”）。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"1ecb4be2\" id=\"1ecb4be2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf58a4e39\" id=\"uf58a4e39\">3. 多模态标注</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u013c9966\"><li fid=\"u02aa03d7\" data-lake-id=\"uaf592452\" id=\"uaf592452\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u178c9caa\" id=\"u178c9caa\">标注工具</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubd33c860\" id=\"ubd33c860\">：定制CVAT+LabelStudio混合平台： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u013c9966\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ue2461c0f\" data-lake-id=\"u1c1e730e\" id=\"u1c1e730e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u779c0ac5\" id=\"u779c0ac5\">影像层：标注结节位置（Bounding Box）及恶性概率（1-5级）。</span></li><li fid=\"ue2461c0f\" data-lake-id=\"u4b55a536\" id=\"u4b55a536\"><span data-lake-id=\"u049280f4\" id=\"u049280f4\">文本层：高亮报告中的关键描述（如“边缘不规则”）。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u013c9966\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u02aa03d7\" data-lake-id=\"u1d47ba6e\" id=\"u1d47ba6e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucea6e449\" id=\"ucea6e449\">专家协同</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5e8886cf\" id=\"u5e8886cf\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u013c9966\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ue56a37b6\" data-lake-id=\"ua25e024a\" id=\"ua25e024a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u74309e55\" id=\"u74309e55\">初筛：3名住院医师标注，共识率≥85%的病例直接入库。</span></li><li fid=\"ue56a37b6\" data-lake-id=\"u1f949324\" id=\"u1f949324\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1450fb52\" id=\"u1450fb52\">复审：分歧病例由主任医师仲裁，标注耗时降低57%。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"43c18a03\" id=\"43c18a03\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubcb1d9ee\" id=\"ubcb1d9ee\">4. 数据存储与版本化</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u5a981465\"><li fid=\"u23ae77eb\" data-lake-id=\"ufd2fec3d\" id=\"ufd2fec3d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u45a89e5d\" id=\"u45a89e5d\">存储结构</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u80b3c3fc\" id=\"u80b3c3fc\">： </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dataset%2F%5Cn%E2%94%9C%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20images%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20DICOM%E8%BD%ACPNG%EF%BC%88512x512%EF%BC%89%5Cn%E2%94%82%20%20%20%E2%94%9C%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20patient001_slice01.png%5Cn%E2%94%82%20%20%20%E2%94%94%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20patient001_slice02.png%5Cn%E2%94%9C%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20reports%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%84%B1%E6%95%8F%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%5Cn%E2%94%82%20%20%20%E2%94%9C%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20patient001.json%20%20%20%23%20%7Btext%3A%20%5C%22%E5%B7%A6%E8%82%BA%E4%B8%8A%E5%8F%B6%E8%A7%816mm%E7%BB%93%E8%8A%82...%5C%22%2C%20labels%3A%20%7B%5C%22GGO%5C%22%3A%201%7D%7D%5Cn%E2%94%94%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20metadata.csv%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%82%A3%E8%80%85ID%2C%E5%BD%B1%E5%83%8F%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%2C%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%2C%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%A8%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x4YqB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u5a981465\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u23ae77eb\" data-lake-id=\"ud295c3f4\" id=\"ud295c3f4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf5ff46ec\" id=\"uf5ff46ec\">版本控制</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue3eb9698\" id=\"ue3eb9698\">：使用DVC（Data Version Control）跟踪数据变更，关键版本打Tag（如v1.2-标注完成）。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"61ce6a6f\" id=\"61ce6a6f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7683485d\" id=\"u7683485d\">5. 隐私与合规</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"uaaaf9d88\"><li fid=\"u0dff3e91\" data-lake-id=\"u8ad4e13e\" id=\"u8ad4e13e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua25cf9fc\" id=\"ua25cf9fc\">脱敏方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u843d2502\" id=\"u843d2502\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"uaaaf9d88\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ud44c4c7b\" data-lake-id=\"u2887f7a8\" id=\"u2887f7a8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uea6c31f6\" id=\"uea6c31f6\">DICOM头信息清除：删除PatientName、StudyDate等字段。</span></li><li fid=\"ud44c4c7b\" data-lake-id=\"ubbf95341\" id=\"ubbf95341\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2749cfed\" id=\"u2749cfed\">文本混淆：使用BERT-Medical生成合成报告（保留医学特征但虚构患者信息）。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"uaaaf9d88\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u0dff3e91\" data-lake-id=\"u845ab123\" id=\"u845ab123\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3177d12f\" id=\"u3177d12f\">审计追踪</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u70a885d7\" id=\"u70a885d7\">：所有数据访问记录存于区块链（Hyperledger Fabric），满足GDPR“被遗忘权”。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CcGgo%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"bd6c56ad\" id=\"bd6c56ad\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0edaa4f\" id=\"ub0edaa4f\">三、参考回答</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u17d7c4b4\" id=\"u17d7c4b4\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752984170253-90a5031b-1ed5-4f57-95cb-2e373ac30a30.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue03d6d10-ee72-4e9f-ade2-6e152a999df%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u90e4180e-0e8b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A340%2C%22height%22%3A311%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A124640%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A765%2C%22originHeight%22%3A699%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%9A%E6%BA%90%E5%BC%82%E6%9E%84%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A582%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A154%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A583%2C%22y%22%3A508%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%B7%A8%E6%A8%A1%E6%80%81%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A582%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A128%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E5%90%88%E8%A7%84%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A582%2C%22y%22%3A646%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%B8%85%E6%B4%97%22%2C%22x%22%