<h5 data-lake-id=\"4899e003\" id=\"4899e003\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf6f73f14\" id=\"uf6f73f14\">1. 数据收集：解决多源异构</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"uca478a4d\"><li fid=\"u9528c726\" data-lake-id=\"u121ff325\" id=\"u121ff325\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaa75a0f3\" id=\"uaa75a0f3\">案例实践</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue8956ba8\" id=\"ue8956ba8\">：通过PACS-API和OCR双通道采集数据，开发ID映射中间件解决模态对齐问题，使影像-报告匹配率从60%提升至92%。</span></li><li fid=\"u9528c726\" data-lake-id=\"u2c6e7365\" id=\"u2c6e7365\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u40da232b\" id=\"u40da232b\">通用方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2d04bcb1\" id=\"u2d04bcb1\">：定义统一Schema（如患者ID、时间戳），使用Apache NiFi实现流式数据管道。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"d705f7ca\" id=\"d705f7ca\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u329ff076\" id=\"u329ff076\">2. 数据清洗：跨模态质量提升</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u35d7cd83\"><li fid=\"u65d2765b\" data-lake-id=\"u104b50e3\" id=\"u104b50e3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u47eb0adc\" id=\"u47eb0adc\">案例实践</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u30e03805\" id=\"u30e03805\">：HU值归一化使模型训练收敛速度提升3倍；术语归一化减少文本噪声35%。</span></li><li fid=\"u65d2765b\" data-lake-id=\"u4ef42aa3\" id=\"u4ef42aa3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue7446760\" id=\"ue7446760\">通用方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u32608267\" id=\"u32608267\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u35d7cd83\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"udd1806bf\" data-lake-id=\"u3e26f606\" id=\"u3e26f606\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6bbc43a7\" id=\"u6bbc43a7\">图像：直方图均衡化/仿射变换。</span></li><li fid=\"udd1806bf\" data-lake-id=\"u014c4445\" id=\"u014c4445\"><span data-lake-id=\"u37a985f7\" id=\"u37a985f7\">文本：正则表达式规则库+LLM纠错（如GPT-4修复错别字）。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"631d1b03\" id=\"631d1b03\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u88dc3d54\" id=\"u88dc3d54\">3. 标注策略：人机协同降本增效</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u1ac7df3c\"><li fid=\"ub3452876\" data-lake-id=\"ub4c5d476\" id=\"ub4c5d476\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u727fef20\" id=\"u727fef20\">案例实践</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uac0b4178\" id=\"uac0b4178\">：住院医师初筛+主任仲裁机制，标注成本从</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub404ee47\" id=\"ub404ee47\">$15/例降至$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9e27d450\" id=\"u9e27d450\">6.5/例。</span></li><li fid=\"ub3452876\" data-lake-id=\"u48fe23c7\" id=\"u48fe23c7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubbf0d989\" id=\"ubbf0d989\">通用方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2c463042\" id=\"u2c463042\">：预标注（如用Grounding DINO初标）+人工校验，节省50%人力。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"067ae8e2\" id=\"067ae8e2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u917b7b8e\" id=\"u917b7b8e\">4. 存储优化：兼顾效率与可追溯</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u460b0b13\"><li fid=\"ubcb7e23b\" data-lake-id=\"u266a6489\" id=\"u266a6489\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u198979ed\" id=\"u198979ed\">案例实践</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7114f6a8\" id=\"u7114f6a8\">：PNG压缩使存储成本降低70%；DVC版本控制实现数据溯源。</span></li><li fid=\"ubcb7e23b\" data-lake-id=\"u806c4c33\" id=\"u806c4c33\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7cfb201a\" id=\"u7cfb201a\">通用方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u54df1f85\" id=\"u54df1f85\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u460b0b13\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ubb89243f\" data-lake-id=\"u1be0cf95\" id=\"u1be0cf95\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf8e81cb1\" id=\"uf8e81cb1\">小文件合并为TFRecord。</span></li><li fid=\"ubb89243f\" data-lake-id=\"uf95be794\" id=\"uf95be794\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18076216\" id=\"u18076216\">元数据存于Elasticsearch支持快速检索。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"6306aacf\" id=\"6306aacf\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf49bb37a\" id=\"uf49bb37a\">5. 合规性设计：隐私保护贯穿全流程</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u9c633a9d\"><li fid=\"u699c6e89\" data-lake-id=\"u255196a6\" id=\"u255196a6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uae8ce687\" id=\"uae8ce687\">案例实践</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc1488257\" id=\"uc1488257\">：合成报告经3名医生盲测，医学准确性达94%。</span></li><li fid=\"u699c6e89\" data-lake-id=\"u3847f28e\" id=\"u3847f28e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4c0665ee\" id=\"u4c0665ee\">通用方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5d780607\" id=\"u5d780607\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u9c633a9d\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ue7312db3\" data-lake-id=\"u63962515\" id=\"u63962515\"><span data-lake-id=\"u495dfd16\" id=\"u495dfd16\">差分隐私（Differential Privacy）加噪。</span></li><li fid=\"ue7312db3\" data-lake-id=\"uc5ace1be\" id=\"uc5ace1be\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1aae890f\" id=\"u1aae890f\">联邦学习（Federated Learning）避免原始数据出域。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tOAT2%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"7b2e44f4\" id=\"7b2e44f4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01ec0c5a\" id=\"u01ec0c5a\">四、总结归纳</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u6f8af326\" id=\"u6f8af326\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752984186774-4c8d1fba-42da-4625-a125-1c4c5af09ae0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3bfeb37d-a4fe-4613-9224-1d57c79d463%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u90e4180e-0e8b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A416.22222900390625%2C%22height%22%3A235%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A68748%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A752%2C%22originHeight%22%3A424%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%8C%96%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%22%2C%22x%22%3A561%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%93%E4%B8%9A%E6%80%A7%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A562%2C%22y%22%3A160%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A7%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8C%91%E6%88%98%E5%BA%94%E5%AF%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%A8%E6%B5%81%E6%B0%B4%E7%BA%BF%22%2C%22x%22%3A562%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BC%82%E6%9E%84%