412368f3\" id=\"u412368f3\">医学专业性</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u07a99620\" id=\"u07a99620\">：放射科专家深度参与标注规则设计</span></li><li fid=\"u91ddc290\" data-lake-id=\"ucd138572\" id=\"ucd138572\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub09315e5\" id=\"ub09315e5\">工程化思维</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u14f5f41b\" id=\"u14f5f41b\">：DVC版本控制/Apache NiFi管道提升可维护性</span></li><li fid=\"u91ddc290\" data-lake-id=\"ued0c8c0f\" id=\"ued0c8c0f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9f014993\" id=\"u9f014993\">合规前置</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaecbc971\" id=\"uaecbc971\">：脱敏方案需在数据采集前通过伦理委员会审批</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u8bdf55ce\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u05424f7f\" data-lake-id=\"uaad6af99\" id=\"uaad6af99\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0213497a\" id=\"u0213497a\">通用方法论</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5565ad80\" id=\"u5565ad80\">：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uf2b613fb\" id=\"uf2b613fb\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752983749005-c18c71b4-b995-4761-89a8-7725f52805e7.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22udf4e5d4b-04fc-4572-8e08-1f5bacebb6d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ua737d3d8-aeaf-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A804.8%2C%22height%22%3A96%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A34437%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1509%2C%22originHeight%22%3A180%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9C%BA%E5%8D%8F%E5%90%8C%E6%A0%87%E6%B3%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A789%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%B7%A8%E6%A8%A1%E6%80%81%E6%B8%85%E6%B4%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A511%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A1077%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%BA%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%90%88%E8%A7%84%E5%AE%A1%E8%AE%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A1355%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A8%A1%E6%80%81%E5%AF%B9%E9%BD%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A79%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3f2fa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uffc2d016%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc682d047\" id=\"uc682d047\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u189f23d9\" id=\"u189f23d9\">经验启示</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u56e9b209\" id=\"u56e9b209\">：医疗场景的严格合规要求倒逼出系统化解决方案，此框架可复用于金融、安防等敏感领域。未来方向是构建自动化合成数据引擎，进一步降低真实数据依赖。</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 1515, "description": "一、答题思路多模态预训练数据集构建需解决数据异构性、标注一致性、隐私合规性三大核心问题。以下以医疗影像诊断项目为例，说明从数据收集到落地的全流程解决方案。二、项目案例：医疗影像智能诊断系统场景与痛点场景需求：构建能同时解析CT影像和诊断报告的多模态模型，辅助医生识别肺部结节。核心痛点： 数据孤...", "updated_at": "2025-07-22T06:19:53.000Z", "created_at": "2025-07-21T01:58:20.000Z", "id": 228860305, "status": 1}